* '''Rakshasa shape:''' Can cast [[ice storm]], [[Mestil's acid breath]] and [[dispel magic]] unlimited times per day.
**Like an NPC rakshasa, a shifter is vulnerable to [[blessed bolt|blessed crossbow bolts]] with the ''on-hit: slay rakshasa'' ability.
**[[Damage reduction]]: 15/+5
**Immunity to level 8 spells and lower.
**Skill bonuses: +15 [[spellcraft]], +11 [[move silently]], +10 [[hide]], +10 [[spot]], +5 [[discipline]]
**Bonus feats: [[dodge]], [[knockdown]], [[true seeing]]
**Universal save +2
**Merges weapons, items, and armor.
**Weapon: ''rakshasa staff +5'', 1d10 [[fire damage]]
*'''Death slaad shape:''' Is large-sized (-1 AB, -1 AC, -4 hide).
** It has the [[chaos spittle]] ability, a ranged [[touch attack]] that deals (shifter levels / 3 + 2)d4 [[magical damage]].
**Regeneration +5
**Immunity to [[fear]].
**Damage reduction 10/+5
**[[Damage resistance]]: acid/10, cold/10, electricity/10, fire/10, sonic/10
**Bonus feats: [[cleave]], [[power attack]]
**Merges armor only.
*'''Azer shape:'''
** Can cast [[burning hands]] and [[fire stream]] unlimited times per day.
**Spell resistance 12
**Immunity increased: fire 100%
**Immunity decreased: cold 50%
**Weapon: ''azer flaming waraxe +5'' (really a [[dwarven waraxe]]) 2d4 fire damage
**Bonus feats: [[cleave]], [[knockdown]], [[power attack]]
**Merges weapons, items, and armor.

* The spells ''burning hands'', ''ice storm'', ''Mestil's acid breath'', and ''dispel magic'' are the same spells that can be found in a [[spellbook]]. Thus [[quickslot]]s for these spells can be used to cast the (unlimited) shifted abilities, and can be used to apply [[metamagic]]. See [[shifted ability]] for details.

== Custom content notes ==

*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.

